    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "C24D2E51CE0315CB",
      "text": "¡Tu combate contra Cass estuvo flama![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "C24D2F51CE03177E",
      "text": "¡No había perdido un solo combate desde que\\nvolvió de Noroteo, pero tú lo dejaste frito![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "C24D3051CE031931",
      "text": "¡Tu victoria marcará un antes y un después en la\\nLiga Arándano![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "C24D3151CE031AE4",
      "text": "Ahora que te has coronado Campe[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0302)]ónona, Cass será\\ndegradado a miembro regular del Alto Mando.[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0302"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "C24D3251CE031C97",
      "text": "Lo malo es que eso significa que el eslabón más\\ndébil... o sea, yo... ¡se quedará fuera del grupo![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "3E4ABBAA2F752252",
      "text": "Qué va, hombre",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "3E4ABAAA2F75209F",
      "text": "¿Estás seguro?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_06",
      "hash64": "C24D3351CE031E4A",
      "text": "A ver, no te negaré que fastidia... pero las reglas\\nson las reglas y hay que acatarlas.[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_07",
      "hash64": "C24D3451CE031FFD",
      "text": "Lo importante es que el ambiente en el club ha\\nvuelto por fin a ser el que era.\\c\\n¡Solo por eso, a mí ya me vale la pena![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_bb4kings_honoo_sp01_08",
      "hash64": "C24D2551CE030680",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Y todo te lo debemos a ti, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].\\nQuería darte\\r\\nlas gracias en persona.[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
